rrect {:answer/id #uuid "503051c7-7699-5964-8964-d46e6f2c433b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}\\ne\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681282} :answer-field/id #uuid "ea74e4e7-2b44-5dc4-830b-ac044a0b317f" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681357} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7e19a48d-0245-5516-a3fd-7310896fb971" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-x^{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}x + \\frac{2 y^{3}}{x^{4}}\\,\\mathrm{d}y" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681300} {:answer/id #uuid "9bc9cd7f-32b7-50f5-b11c-7f0ead170aa1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2 y^{3}}{x^{4}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x - \\frac{y^{2}}{x^{3}}\\,\\mathrm{d}y" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681317} {:answer/id #uuid "9da404fe-529d-57e9-843a-3644d32a29e3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2 y^{3}}{x^{4}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x + x^{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}y" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681318} {:answer/id #uuid "edfb5c1a-c9b3-5158-a2a4-df1b93edf52e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{y^{2}}{x^{3}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x + \\frac{2 y^{3}}{x^{4}}\\,\\mathrm{d}y" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681360}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9bc9cd7f-32b7-50f5-b11c-7f0ead170aa1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2 y^{3}}{x^{4}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x - \\frac{y^{2}}{x^{3}}\\,\\mathrm{d}y" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681317} :answer-field/id #uuid "f7b7e4c7-1b0b-5bad-bb61-056dd68e60a6" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681368}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "046a0fbe-2a79-5b5c-bf92-9171c9aaa131" :question/problem "Consider the following inexact differential equation, on a region where $x\\ne0$ and $y\\ne0$.\n\n$$\n2 y^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x - x y\\,\\mathrm{d}y=0\n$$\n\nSelect the correct options in the reasoning below about whether $I(x,y)=\\frac{y}{x^{4}}$ is an integrating factor of this equation.\n\nTo test this candidate, multiply both coefficients and check whether the following equation is exact:\n\n$$\n{{field-1}}=0\n$$\n\nFor this equation, let\n\n$$\nP=\\frac{2 y^{3}}{x^{4}},\\qquad Q=-\\frac{y^{2}}{x^{3}}.\n$$\n\nThe corresponding partial derivatives are\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}={{field-2}},\\qquad \\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}={{field-3}}.\n$$\n\nNow, since\n\n$$\n{{field-4}},\n$$\n\nthe transformed equation {{field-5}} exact.\n\nTherefore, $I(x,y)=\\frac{y}{x^{4}}$ {{field-6}} an integrating factor for the initial differential equation." :question/worked-solution "A candidate is an integrating factor if multiplying the equation by it gives an exact equation. First multiply both coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{y}{x^{4}}\\left(2 y^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x - x y\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\right)&=0 \\\\ \\frac{2 y^{3}}{x^{4}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x - \\frac{y^{2}}{x^{3}}\\,\\mathrm{d}y&=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor the transformed equation,\n\n$$\nP=\\frac{2 y^{3}}{x^{4}},\\qquad Q=-\\frac{y^{2}}{x^{3}}.\n$$\n\nThe exactness test compares the partial derivatives as functions on the region:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}&=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial y}\\left(\\frac{2 y^{3}}{x^{4}}\\right)=\\frac{6 y^{2}}{x^{4}} \\\\ \\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}&=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial x}\\left(-\\frac{y^{2}}{x^{3}}\\right)=\\frac{3 y^{2}}{x^{4}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}\\ne\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x},\n$$\n\nthe transformed equation isn't exact. Therefore, $I(x,y)=\\frac{y}{x^{4}}$ isn't an integrating factor for the initial equation."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186681257 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b631f9bb-eb98-5224-870d-955ddc23d4e6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681334} {:answer/id #uuid "d02db6c8-7a22-50a3-8e11-eb9ef29913a5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{y}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681345} {:answer/id #uuid "ea21dacf-0317-5084-8ded-d669f0569302" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681356} {:answer/id #uuid "f58ffe70-c249-51bd-8a06-9ad3870918cb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{y}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681367}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ea21dacf-0317-5084-8ded-d669f0569302" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681356} :answer-field/id #uuid "5e56f1ed-0400-5445-a835-f649471e9ab3" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681290} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0fa869a1-14b7-50a9-85d9-5825dbf60a2f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-x^{3} y\\,\\mathrm{d}x + \\frac{y}{x}\\,\\mathrm{d}y" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681252} {:answer/id #uuid "5574cbc9-1f53-546f-98bd-fed97ebec81e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{y}{x}\\,\\mathrm{d}x - \\frac{x}{y}\\,\\mathrm{d}y" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681285} {:answer/id #uuid "c5794091-489c-5cd9-b6e1-aded901288e1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{x}{y}\\,\\mathrm{d}x + \\frac{y}{x}\\,\\mat