 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681752} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "74d3f570-eab2-5eeb-a6e4-f5c3b089dc02" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{aligned}&\\left(\\frac{e^{\\frac{1}{3 y^{2}}}}{y^{3}}\\right)\\, [\\\\ &\\quad \\left(3 y^{4}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\ &\\quad {}+\\left(- x y\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}y]=0\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681754} {:answer/id #uuid "965a5f88-1260-5918-bb76-e339ca7268ba" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{aligned}&\\left(\\frac{e^{\\frac{1}{6 y^{2}}}}{y^{3}}\\right)\\, [\\\\ &\\quad \\left(3 y^{4}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\ &\\quad {}+\\left(- x y\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}y]=0\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681774} {:answer/id #uuid "a27d354e-2f27-5dec-a06b-765dee359094" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{aligned}&\\left(\\frac{e^{\\frac{1}{3 y^{2}}}}{y^{4}}\\right)\\, [\\\\ &\\quad \\left(3 y^{4}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\ &\\quad {}+\\left(- x y\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}y]=0\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681781} {:answer/id #uuid "a6247c51-4307-5a08-8f39-06ac124671c3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{aligned}&\\left(\\frac{e^{\\frac{1}{6 y^{2}}}}{y^{4}}\\right)\\, [\\\\ &\\quad \\left(3 y^{4}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\ &\\quad {}+\\left(- x y\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}y]=0\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681785}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a6247c51-4307-5a08-8f39-06ac124671c3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{aligned}&\\left(\\frac{e^{\\frac{1}{6 y^{2}}}}{y^{4}}\\right)\\, [\\\\ &\\quad \\left(3 y^{4}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\ &\\quad {}+\\left(- x y\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}y]=0\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681785} :answer-field/id #uuid "de34c07d-46e4-584a-84c5-0980c59b2381" :answer-field/key "field-7" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186681826}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "abc1ea10-fd62-585d-a864-b8ce27f4a82a" :question/problem "Find an integrating factor to convert the following differential equation into an **exact equation**. Select the correct options in the reasoning below.\n\n$$\n\\left(3 y^{4}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x+\\left(- x y\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}y=0,\\qquad y>0\n$$\n\nFor an equation of the form\n\n$$\nP(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{d}x+Q(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{d}y=0\n$$\n\nif\n\n$$\n{{field-1}}=h(y)\n$$\n\nwhere $h(y)$ is independent of $x$, an integrating factor is\n\n$$\nI(y)={{field-2}}\n$$\n\nHere $\\exp(y)$ denotes $e^y$.\n\nDenote\n\n$$\nP(x,y)=3 y^{4},\\qquad Q(x,y)=- x y\n$$\n\nCompute the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}={{field-3}}\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}={{field-4}}\n$$\n\nFor this equation,\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{P}\\left(\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}-\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}\\right)={{field-5}}\n$$\n\nThis depends on $y$ only, so\n\n$$\nI(y)={{field-6}}\n$$\n\nMultiplying gives the exact equation\n\n$$\n{{field-7}}\n$$\n\n" :question/worked-solution "For an equation in differential form, the condition is\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{P}\\left(\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}-\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}\\right)=h(y)\n$$\n\nwith $h(y)$ independent of $x$. Then\n\n$$\nI(y)=\\exp\\left(-\\int h(y)\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\right)\n$$\n\nSet\n\n$$\nP(x,y)=3 y^{4},\\qquad Q(x,y)=- x y\n$$\n\nCompute the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}&=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial y}\\left(3 y^{4}\\right)=12 y^{3} \\\\ \\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}&=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial x}\\left(- x y\\right)=- y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{P}\\left(\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}-\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}\\right)&=\\frac{1}{3 y^{4}}\\left[\\left(12 y^{3}\\right)-\\left(- y\\right)\\right] \\\\ &=\\frac{12 y^{2} + 1}{3 y^{3}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeparating the powers gives\n\n$$\nh(y)=\\frac{4}{y} + \\frac{1}{3 y^{3}}\n$$\n\nThe ratio depends on $y$ only. On the stated domain,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I(y)&=\\exp\\left(-\\int\\left(\\frac{4}{y} + \\frac{1}{3 y^{3}}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\right) \\\\ &=\\exp\\left(-\\left(4 \\ln{\\left(y \\right)} - \\frac{1}{6 y^{2}}\\right)\\right) \\\\ &=\\exp\\left(-4\\ln y\\right)\\exp\\left(\\frac{1}{6 y^{2}}\\right) \\\\ &=\\frac{e^{\\frac{1}{6 y^{2}}}}{y^{4}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe choose the arbitrary nonzero constant multiplier to be $1$. Here $y>0$ permits the logarithm and exponential conversion. Multiplying the original equation by this factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\left(\\frac{e^{\\frac{1}{6 y^{2}}}}{y^{4}}\\right)\\, [\\\\ &\\quad \\left(3 y^{4}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\ &\\quad {}+\\left(- x y\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}y]=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186690102 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "02cff958-1aff-56f1-bebb-8777b8ce2f3b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\exp(h(y))" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186690046} {:answer/id #uuid "a200250d-fbf1-5794-b6e7-df865fa6b058" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\exp(-h(y))" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186690120} {:answer/id #uuid "d4a6e3cd-a558-5fa8-aa66-c3cf75075e24" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\exp\\left(\\int h(y)\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186690140} {:answer/id #uuid "fa3edebb-f1de-5f44-9813-6b19713f6878" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\exp\\left(-\\int h(y)\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186690161}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #u