thrm{d}y=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186690318} {:answer/id #uuid "6c92cabb-6829-59e2-b72b-523a185759db" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x^2-2y)\\,\\mathrm{d}x+x\\,\\mathrm{d}y=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186690344} {:answer/id #uuid "9e125aa3-c1e4-5c20-9a0b-bee1448bee16" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x\\,\\mathrm{d}x+(x^2-2y)\\,\\mathrm{d}y=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186690355}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6c92cabb-6829-59e2-b72b-523a185759db" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x^2-2y)\\,\\mathrm{d}x+x\\,\\mathrm{d}y=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186690344} :answer-field/id #uuid "d47982c0-11b2-580d-8ae9-bc5481ca8f48" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186690384} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "43f37ff8-b8ef-519e-ba52-53bbba1ba799" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x^{3}\\left((x^2-2y)\\,\\mathrm{d}x+x\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\right)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186690332} {:answer/id #uuid "ba058fd3-441c-5197-9eb7-48e2138db6f3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x^{-2}\\left((x^2-2y)\\,\\mathrm{d}x+x\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\right)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186690371} {:answer/id #uuid "be7298d7-bd30-568d-b027-4c517f046331" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "e^{-3/x}\\left((x^2-2y)\\,\\mathrm{d}x+x\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\right)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186690374} {:answer/id #uuid "c096d536-2d60-5cc5-8ed4-d5fd6c364df5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x^{-3}\\left((x^2-2y)\\,\\mathrm{d}x+x\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\right)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186690376}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c096d536-2d60-5cc5-8ed4-d5fd6c364df5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x^{-3}\\left((x^2-2y)\\,\\mathrm{d}x+x\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\right)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186690376} :answer-field/id #uuid "f7ff2473-963a-5097-8c69-91cb0ce87971" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186690399}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "c14b6107-46f2-57d5-a588-ef784642c6b1" :question/problem "Find an integrating factor depending on $x$ alone that makes the following equation exact, on $x>0$:\n\n$$\nxy'=2y-x^2.\n$$\n\nUse the differential form obtained by moving the right-hand side to the left and multiplying by $\\mathrm{d}x$, without dividing by $x$. Select the entries below. Choose the integrating factor normalized by $I(1)=1$.\n\nDifferential form:\n\n$$\n{{field-1}}.\n$$\n\nFor this form, compute the quotient:\n\n$$\n\\frac{P_y-Q_x}{Q}={{field-2}}.\n$$\n\nThen an integrating factor is\n\n$$\nI(x)={{field-3}},\n$$\n\nand multiplying the differential form by it gives the exact equation\n\n$$\n{{field-4}}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Moving all terms to the left and multiplying by $\\mathrm{d}x$ gives\n\n$$\n(x^2-2y)\\,\\mathrm{d}x+x\\,\\mathrm{d}y=0.\n$$\n\nThus\n\n$$\nP=x^2-2y,\\qquad Q=x,\\qquad P_y=-2,\\qquad Q_x=1.\n$$\n\nThe derivatives differ, so the original form is inexact. The quotient is\n\n$$\n\\frac{P_y-Q_x}{Q}=\\frac{-2-1}{x}=-\\frac{3}{x}.\n$$\n\nIt depends only on $x$. Exactness after multiplication requires $I P_y=I\\,Q_x+I' Q$, so $I'/I=(P_y-Q_x)/Q$. Therefore\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I(x)&=\\exp\\left(\\int -\\frac{3}{x}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\right)\\\\&=\\exp(-3\\ln x)\\\\&=x^{-3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe domain $x>0$ justifies $\\ln x$. The condition $I(1)=1$ fixes the multiplicative constant. Multiplication gives\n\n$$\nx^{-3}\\left((x^2-2y)\\,\\mathrm{d}x+x\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\right)=0.\n$$\n\nTo check exactness afterward, write the coefficients as $M=x^{-1}-2yx^{-3}$ and $N=x^{-2}$. Then\n\n$$\nM_y=-2x^{-3}=N_x.\n$$\n\nThe transformed form is exact. Dividing the original differential form by $x$ first would change the integrating factor required; the specified form keeps that choice unambiguous."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186691796 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1f70480f-bb7f-5c60-b671-741e30b912bf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "e^{3 x^{2}}((6 x y)\\,\\text{d}x+\\,\\text{d}y)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691795} {:answer/id #uuid "4ed7014c-24ce-584c-9359-e4b80dda26f0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "e^{- 3 x^{2}}((6 x y)\\,\\text{d}x+\\,\\text{d}y)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691811} {:answer/id #uuid "85845ebb-0cdd-57fa-a925-abff6809810b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "e^{- \\frac{3 x^{2}}{2}}((6 x y)\\,\\text{d}x+\\,\\text{d}y)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691830} {:answer/id #uuid "f726b2c7-c508-5c24-b289-c762b7bc36a6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "e^{\\frac{3 x^{2}}{2}}((6 x y)\\,\\text{d}x+\\,\\text{d}y)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691884}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1f70480f-bb7f-5c60-b671-741e30b912bf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "e^{3 x^{2}}((6 x y)\\,\\text{d}x+\\,\\text{d}y)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691795} :answer-field/id #uuid "0bbbabc2-b68b-5fca-94b6-086a791c7ccb" :answer-field/key "field-7" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186691787} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1e56ef59-8ab7-5701-aecf-c801f7143a28" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{P}(\\frac{\\partial P}{\\par